flowchart TD
  A["选择频道或未知 `channelId`"] --> B["im.channels.ensureLoaded"]
  B --> C["Venus/C++ JSON stringify 或 host observation"]
  C --> D["`im_channel_load_increment_by_channel_id`"]
  D --> E["Helix V1 Tick/Effect 路径"]
  E --> F["`POST /api/cses/channel/load/incrementByChannelId` body `{channelId}`"]
  F --> G["无直接 WS；后续可能收到 `increment_channel`"]
  G --> H["批量 raw DomainEvent 回调 C++"]
  H --> I["Venus owning-thread tick / MobileImSdk legacy reducer"]
  I --> J["JS/C++ 重建：未知频道加载成功后频道头、输入区和时间线同时可用；失败时保留原频道"]
  E -. "Persist/HTTP/WS 失败" .-> X["raw failure event 或 SOURCE_MISSING"]
  X --> I
